<title>UK: CLF Hypo sets 100 million mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>CLF Hypo sets 100 million mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers GZB and SGZ.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CLF HYPOTHEKENBANK BERLIN AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    *4.375     MATURITY    17.SEP.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  99.90     PAY DATE    17.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING    BERLIN    DENOMS (K) 10	  FULL FEES   UNDISCL</p>
<p> NOTES	UNTIL 17.SEP.97 THEN IF NOT CALLED AT PAR STEPS-UP</p>
<p>		TO 4.75 PCT THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
